Test pages and images, saved from The Millionth (the author's news site, from the
retro-homepage project) as it rendered them:

front.html, story.html, weather.html: its pages, with lorem ipsum in place of the
news text.
masthead-s.gif: its masthead. partly.gif: its "partly cloudy" weather icon. Both
drawn for The Millionth.
rainier-t.jpg: its thumbnail of the National Park Service's Mount Rainier from
Paradise webcam (https://www.nps.gov/webcams-mora/mountain.jpg). Public domain:
a work of the US government.

tables-nested.html, tables-portal.html, tables-config.html, tables-forum.html: pages
heavy with tables, made up for timing and checking layout (lorem ipsum again): tables
nested six deep with most of what a cell can hold, a portal's columns of boxes, a
settings form like mill://config, and a forum thread with a data table.
layout.sums: hashes of how test_layout.c lays the pages out, from before layout was
made faster; it must not change. Remake it only when layout is meant to change:
test_layout sums > tests/fixtures/layout.sums
